{"product_id":"human-geography-places-and-regions-in-global-context-second-canadian-edition","title":"Human Geography: Places And Regions in Global Context, Second Canadian Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eHuman Geography: Places and Regions in Global Context remains unsurpassed as the only textbook available to provide up-to-date human geography material within a Canadian and global context. This second Canadian edition includes the most recent information available, providing professors with a tool to more effectively help their students understand today's world. \"In order to understand places, they must first be made meaningful to us.\" The authors’ exciting contemporary approach gives people and places meaning by covering compelling topics that integrate today's local, regional, and global perspectives.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:25 x 279  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Paul L. Knox | Sallie A. Marston | Alan E. Nash \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780131960336 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Applicable \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 608\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44646384140441,"sku":"3EDU9780131960336","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/e290957294a7ad72a258133335f9a7c7.jpg?v=1721730514","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/human-geography-places-and-regions-in-global-context-second-canadian-edition","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}